Rāvaṇa rebukes his driver for withdrawing --- Rāvaṇa calls the driver coward and traitor --- Rāvaṇa orders the chariot turned back --- The driver denies fear and treachery --- The driver cites exhausted horses and ill omens --- The driver says devotion moved him to spare Rāvaṇa --- Rāvaṇa praises the driver and gifts a bracelet --- The driver speeds the chariot before Rāma
